---
// Added in the figures pass: numbers come from the post text and captures.
const W = 900, H = 300;
---
<figure class="bep5b">
  <div class="bep5b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A pool box with three idle connection slots on the left and a box for a session holding one connection on the right. An arrow to the right is labelled first query, checked out. An arrow back is labelled commit, rollback or close, given back. Below, three default settings: pool_size 5, max_overflow 10, pool_timeout 30 seconds.">
    <rect x="60" y="70" width="240" height="120" rx="12" class="seam" />
    <text x="180" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>pool</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool</tspan></text>
    <rect x="84" y="112" width="60" height="56" rx="6" class="slot" />
    <rect x="156" y="112" width="60" height="56" rx="6" class="slot" />
    <rect x="228" y="112" width="60" height="56" rx="6" class="slot" />
    <text x="180" y="208" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>open connections, lent out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>connection mở sẵn, cho mượn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="560" y="70" width="240" height="120" rx="12" class="box" />
    <text x="680" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>session holds one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session đang giữ một</tspan></text>
    <rect x="620" y="112" width="120" height="56" rx="6" class="badfill" />
    <text x="680" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>in use</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đang dùng</tspan></text>
    <line x1="300" y1="112" x2="550" y2="112" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="560,112 550,107 550,117" class="hd" />
    <text x="430" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>first query: checked out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>query đầu tiên: lấy ra</tspan></text>
    <line x1="560" y1="168" x2="310" y2="168" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="300,168 310,163 310,173" class="hd" />
    <text x="430" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>commit, rollback or close: given back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>commit, rollback hoặc close: trả lại</tspan></text>
    <text x="60" y="252" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>pool_size 5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool_size 5</tspan></text>
    <text x="60" y="272" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>kept open and ready</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giữ mở sẵn</tspan></text>
    <text x="310" y="252" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>+ max_overflow 10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+ max_overflow 10</tspan></text>
    <text x="310" y="272" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>extra under load, closed after</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thêm khi tải cao, đóng lại sau</tspan></text>
    <text x="590" y="252" text-anchor="start" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>pool_timeout 30 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool_timeout 30 s</tspan></text>
    <text x="590" y="272" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>wait for a free one, then fail</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đợi connection rảnh, rồi báo lỗi</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A connection is borrowed on a session's first query and returned when the transaction ends. The three defaults decide how many can be out at once and how long a request waits.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Connection được mượn ở query đầu tiên của session và trả lại khi transaction kết thúc. Ba giá trị mặc định quyết định tối đa bao nhiêu connection được ra ngoài và request đợi bao lâu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5b text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5b .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5b .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5b .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5b .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5b .badfill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5b .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5b .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5b .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5b .dotbad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5b .slot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
